{"id":"6-1-3","courseId":"6","chapterNumber":"1.3","title":"Brøk, desimaltall og prosent","description":"Gjøre om mellom brøk, desimaltall og prosent.","estimatedMinutes":40,"exercises":[],"competenceGoals":["beskrive og bruke plassverdisystemet for desimaltal, rekne med positive og negative heile tal, desimaltal, brøkar og prosent"],"content":[{"id":"6-1-3-intro","type":"text","content":"## Tre måter å skrive det samme\n\nBrøk, desimaltall og prosent er tre måter å uttrykke samme verdi:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2} = 0,5 = 50\\%$$\n\n$$\\frac{3}{4} = 0,75 = 75\\%$$"},{"id":"6-1-3-omregning","type":"definition","title":"Omregning","content":"**Brøk → Desimaltall:** Del telleren på nevneren\n$$\\frac{3}{4} = 3 \\div 4 = 0,75$$\n\n**Desimaltall → Prosent:** Gang med 100\n$$0,75 \\cdot 100 = 75\\%$$\n\n**Prosent → Brøk:** Skriv over 100 og forkort\n$$75\\% = \\frac{75}{100} = \\frac{3}{4}$$"},{"id":"6-1-3-vanlige","type":"text","content":"## Vanlige verdier å huske\n\n| Brøk | Desimaltall | Prosent |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| $\\frac{1}{2}$ | 0,5 | 50% |\n| $\\frac{1}{4}$ | 0,25 | 25% |\n| $\\frac{3}{4}$ | 0,75 | 75% |\n| $\\frac{1}{5}$ | 0,2 | 20% |\n| $\\frac{1}{10}$ | 0,1 | 10% |"},{"id":"6-1-3-ex-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Gjør om til desimaltall","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$0,5$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$0,3$"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{7}{20}$","solution":"$0,35$"},{"label":"d","task":"$40\\%$","solution":"$0,4$"}],"solution":"a) 0,5  b) 0,3  c) 0,35  d) 0,4","hints":["Del telleren på nevneren. For prosent: del på 100."]}},{"id":"6-1-3-ex-extra-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-ex-extra-1","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Gjør om til desimaltall","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$0{,}5$","answer":0.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$0{,}75$","answer":0.75},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$0{,}2$","answer":0.2},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{10}$","solution":"$0{,}7$","answer":0.7}],"solution":"a) 0,5, b) 0,75, c) 0,2, d) 0,7","hints":["Del telleren på nevneren"]}},{"id":"6-1-3-ex-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-ex-2","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gjør om til prosent","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{5}$","solution":"$60\\%$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{7}{10}$","solution":"$70\\%$"},{"label":"c","task":"$0,45$","solution":"$45\\%$"},{"label":"d","task":"$0,08$","solution":"$8\\%$"}],"solution":"a) 60%  b) 70%  c) 45%  d) 8%","hints":["Gjør først om til desimaltall, så gang med 100"]}},{"id":"6-1-3-ex-extra-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-ex-extra-2","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gjør om til prosent","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$0{,}25$","solution":"$25\\,\\%$","answer":25},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$50\\,\\%$","answer":50},{"label":"c","task":"$0{,}9$","solution":"$90\\,\\%$","answer":90},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$30\\,\\%$","answer":30}],"solution":"a) 25 %, b) 50 %, c) 90 %, d) 30 %","hints":["Flytt komma to plasser mot høyre"]}},{"id":"6-1-3-ex-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-ex-3","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gjør om til brøk og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$0,6$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{5}$"},{"label":"b","task":"$0,25$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"},{"label":"c","task":"$80\\%$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{5}$"},{"label":"d","task":"$35\\%$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{20}$"}],"solution":"a) 3/5  b) 1/4  c) 4/5  d) 7/20","hints":["Skriv desimaltall som brøk over 10 eller 100, prosent over 100, og forkort"]}},{"id":"6-1-3-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Tre skrivemåter for det samme**: $\\frac{1}{2} = 0{,}5 = 50\\,\\%$.\n- **Brøk → desimaltall**: Del telleren på nevneren.\n- **Desimaltall → prosent**: Gang med 100 (flytt komma to plasser).\n- **Prosent → brøk**: Sett prosenten over 100 og forkort: $25\\,\\% = \\frac{25}{100} = \\frac{1}{4}$.\n\n### Husk!\n- $\\frac{1}{4} = 0{,}25 = 25\\,\\%$\n- $\\frac{3}{4} = 0{,}75 = 75\\,\\%$\n- $\\frac{1}{10} = 0{,}1 = 10\\,\\%$ — lær disse utenat!"},{"id":"6-1-3-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"6-1-3-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Gjør om til desimaltall","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$1 \\div 4 = 0{,}25$","answer":0.25},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$0{,}4$","answer":0.4},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{9}{10}$","solution":"$0{,}9$","answer":0.9},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{5}$","solution":"$0{,}6$","answer":0.6}],"solution":"a) 0,25, b) 0,4, c) 0,9, d) 0,6","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Del telleren på nevneren"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"6-1-3-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Gjør om til prosent","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$0{,}5$","solution":"$50\\,\\%$","answer":50},{"label":"b","task":"$0{,}07$","solution":"$7\\,\\%$","answer":7},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$25\\,\\%$","answer":25},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{4}{5}$","solution":"$80\\,\\%$","answer":80}],"solution":"a) 50 %, b) 7 %, c) 25 %, d) 80 %","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Desimaltall til prosent: gang med 100"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"6-1-3-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gjør om til brøk og forkort maksimalt","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$0{,}5$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{10} = \\frac{1}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/2"},{"label":"b","task":"$25\\,\\%$","solution":"$\\frac{25}{100} = \\frac{1}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"1/4"},{"label":"c","task":"$0{,}75$","solution":"$\\frac{75}{100} = \\frac{3}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"3/4"},{"label":"d","task":"$60\\,\\%$","solution":"$\\frac{60}{100} = \\frac{3}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"3/5"}],"solution":"a) 1/2, b) 1/4, c) 3/4, d) 3/5","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Prosent betyr hundredeler"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"6-1-3-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-3-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Blandede oppgaver","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Hvilket tall er størst: $0{,}7$, $\\frac{3}{4}$ eller $65\\,\\%$? Skriv det som desimaltall.","solution":"$0{,}7$, $0{,}75$ og $0{,}65$ — størst er $\\frac{3}{4} = 0{,}75$","answer":0.75},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{5}$ av elevene syklet til skolen. Hvor mange prosent er det?","solution":"$\\frac{2}{5} = 0{,}4 = 40\\,\\%$","answer":40},{"label":"c","task":"Skriv $0{,}35$ som prosent","solution":"$35\\,\\%$","answer":35},{"label":"d","task":"Skriv $80\\,\\%$ som forkortet brøk","solution":"$\\frac{80}{100} = \\frac{4}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"4/5"}],"solution":"a) 0,75, b) 40 %, c) 35 %, d) 4/5","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gjør om alle til samme form før du sammenligner"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}]}